# Angular client

- Selector prefix: `soclover-`
- Services (root): `ConnectionService` (WS), `ModelService` (game state), `UiService` (set/solve UI), `LayoutService`
- Routes in `app.routes.ts`; auth gate via `ConnectionService.canActivate()`
- Leaf geometry/UI constants: `leafData.ts` — keep SVG/layout math there, not scattered
- When changing sync: update via `ModelService` patches; strip UI-only fields with `cardUImembers` where relevant
- Styles: SCSS colocated with components; global in `styles.scss`
